18% discount. A higher-level approver cannot override this: approving it would require amending the pricing exception or the underlying customer agreement to increase the maximum above 15%.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9112\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"18%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Michael Torres\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception for NS-500, in force 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"20% (VP Sales authority: >10% and ≤20%)\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (VP Sales)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 (customer agreement, effective through 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception, 15% maximum for NS-500)\",\n    \"structured/employees.csv (Michael Torres, VP Sales)\",\n    \"structured/discount_requests.csv (request DR-9112)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"To approve an 18% discount, the pricing exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15) or customer agreement (ACME-MFG-2025) must be amended to increase the NS-500 maximum discount above 15%\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk or Legal\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Answer:** No, Michael Torres cannot approve this discount. Although he has the authority as VP Sales to approve 18%, the customer is eligible for a maximum discount of 15% on NS-500 under the active pricing exception. The requested discount exceeds established eligibility and requires amendment to the customer's pricing terms before approval is possible."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5922,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5922},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"251446c0-422f-4064-8e6a-936425fcc80c","uuid":"d1caef4c-0fd5-42c1-93d6-4d863b9e2643","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:02:58.673Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpf3pHduDYx3BiNuJUki"}
